{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017pqkFiZJTCaKyKB7tKBtZ3","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→import { createElement, Fragment } from 'react';\n     2→import { DOCUMENT_NODE, ELEMENT_NODE, parse, TEXT_NODE } from 'ultrahtml';\n     3→\n     4→let ids = 0;\n     5→export default function convert(children: any) {\n     6→\tlet doc = parse(children.toString().trim());\n     7→\tlet id = ids++;\n     8→\tlet key = 0;\n     9→\n    10→\tfunction createReactElementFromNode(node: any) {\n    11→\t\tconst childVnodes =\n    12→\t\t\tArray.isArray(node.children) && node.children.length\n    13→\t\t\t\t? node.children.map((child: any) => createReactElementFromNode(child)).filter(Boolean)\n    14→\t\t\t\t: undefined;\n    15→\n    16→\t\tif (node.type === DOCUMENT_NODE) {\n    17→\t\t\treturn createElement(Fragment, {}, childVnodes);\n    18→\t\t} else if (node.type === ELEMENT_NODE) {\n    19→\t\t\tconst { class: className, ...props } = node.attributes;\n    20→\t\t\treturn createElement(node.name, { ...props, className, key: `${id}-${key++}` }, childVnodes);\n    21→\t\t} else if (node.type === TEXT_NODE) {\n    22→\t\t\t// 0-length text gets omitted in JSX\n    23→\t\t\treturn node.value.trim() ? node.value : undefined;\n    24→\t\t}\n    25→\t}\n    26→\n    27→\tconst root = createReactElementFromNode(doc);\n    28→\treturn root.props.children;\n    29→}\n    30→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018cewbrAQTiCboLWeF2v3xv","session_id":"7e54f64e-01ee-4d8c-b9c5-40d315771686","uuid":"80d5a2af-65e6-4c99-ab20-63627c17bc1e"}
