{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01FdpoRmPLj54PSuuF4ux5B4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tasks complete. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## React Client Renderer - Implementation Summary\n\n### New files\n- **`assets/renderers/react.ts`** - React implementation of the `FrameworkRenderer` interface\n- **`assets/renderers/react.test.ts`** - 11 tests covering all renderer lifecycle methods\n\n### Modified files\n- **`assets/index.ts`** - Added `createReactRenderer` export\n- **`package.json`** - Added `react`, `react-dom`, `@types/react`, `@types/react-dom` as devDependencies\n\n### Design decisions\n\n| Aspect | Vue Renderer | React Renderer |\n|--------|-------------|----------------|\n| **Mounting** | `createApp`/`createSSRApp` | `createRoot`/`hydrateRoot` |\n| **Reactivity** | Vue `reactive()` wraps props | Plain object, re-render via `root.render()` |\n| **Slots** | `h(\"div\", { innerHTML })` | `createElement(\"span\", { dangerouslySetInnerHTML })` |\n| **Updates** | Mutate reactive props in-place | Mutate props + explicit `root.render()` |\n| **Unmount** | `app.unmount()` on `phx:page-loading-stop` | `root.unmount()` on `phx:page-loading-stop` |\n| **Hook access** | Vue `provide`/`inject` via `liveInjectKey` | `live` prop passed directly |\n| **SSR** | `vue/server-renderer` | `react-dom/server` `renderToString` |\n\nThe React renderer passes the LiveView hook as a `live` prop to components (rather than via context injection like Vue), keeping the API simple and idiomatic for React.\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":66519,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":323},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e54f64